# Test http requests for my api

### GET server root
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Get not found 404
GET http://localhost:3000/notfound

### GET ALL items
GET http://localhost:3000/items

### GET an item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/items/2

### GET false item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/items/999

### POST new item
POST http://localhost:3000/items
content-type: application/json

{"name": "Bruce Wayne", "age": 42, "city": "Gotham City"}

### DELETE item by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/8

### PUT / Modify existing item by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/2
content-type: application/json

{"name": "Peter Parker", "age": 22, "city": "New York City"}